The Mammoth: A Cave Painting is a brief and free narration game. However, it is a beautiful and heartbreaking adventure :  it summarily narrates the story of the mammoths and the hunters.  Play as a mammoth, walk around the plain, gather your children, fight the hunters and discover the horrific fate of your herd. A touching story that could sadly refer to the majority of the extinct animals.
In addition to the narration, the best part of The Mammoth: A Cave Painting is its amazing and lovely art inspired by prehistoric cave-paintings. In my opinion, this is an enjoyable game and a rich experience to discover ; hope to see more games like this one from inbetweengames.
